 it is not.\n\nAdventurers like you are my heroes."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2015-02-26 09:04:56","text":"I think lashing is fantastic.  It's amazing what you can hold together with a few strands of something relatively weak.  \n\nThanks!"},{"author":"30037367@N03","date":"2015-03-08 14:15:53","text":"Been down this road many times."}],"description":"The old cheap metal strap failed while Steph was peddling up a steep hill.  This lead to a snapping of one of the racks supporting legs and a nasty rotation of the rack with guitar to the ground.  The guitar made a sound worse than a dog being accidentally stepped on.","detail":"photos/0049.json","filename":"16603785955_ccc4ed1a3f_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16603785955/","height":3000,"id":"16603785955","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16603785955/16603785955_ccc4ed1a3f_o.jpg","sha256":"152653426fd06652f8d44110adc3c279f64ab741cd5d4b4d8ded379e9b2d28e0","tags":[],"taken":"2014-11-01 18:20:37","title":"IMG_4203","uploaded":"2015-02-21 11:10:13","width":4000},"16603845925":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2927},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":675},{"id":"72157707820344824","position":79}],"bytes":4758087,"camera_position":2927,"comments":[],"description":"Hearst Castle.  I wonder how much William Randolph paid to have the rainbow installed","detail":"photos/0049.json","filename":"16603845925_8f1928f111_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/16603845925/","height":1787,"id":"16603845925","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/16603845925/16603845925_8f1928f111_o.jpg","sha256":"d3d902a3d1a281aba022de5709add4228ede62261523b30810fa4abed6bf0b51","tags":[],"taken":"2014-11-01 16:06:54","title":"IMG_4196","uploaded":"2015-02-21 11:17:15","width":2783},"16603910251":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2935},{"id":"72157646928615774","position":683}],"bytes":102